Content shell: keys, context menus, fullscreen and media requests to the embedder.

The decisions WebContentsDelegate leaves to its embedder and the shell makes
itself: a key before the page (PreHandleKeyboardEvent), the context menu
(HandleContextMenu), whether a page may go fullscreen
(CanEnterFullscreenModeForTab) and that it did, and a camera or microphone
request (RequestMediaAccessPermission). Without an embedder's answer, the
shell does what it did.

